# Broadcast TV (a USB DVB stick stops working: accepted in docs/STACK.md, change 10). The media device types have no
# prompt (and are all y) unless the media filter is on; with it on, the other types keep Void's y (cameras, analog
# TV and radio, SDR, platform and test drivers)
CONFIG_MEDIA_SUPPORT_FILTER=y
# CONFIG_MEDIA_DIGITAL_TV_SUPPORT is not set
# CAN bus (cars and industrial machines)
# CONFIG_CAN is not set
# Cluster and server filesystems
# CONFIG_GFS2_FS is not set
# CONFIG_OCFS2_FS is not set
# CONFIG_DLM is not set
# CONFIG_ORANGEFS_FS is not set
# CONFIG_CODA_FS is not set
# Staging drivers no desktop has: SPI TFT panels, industrial sensors, an old server framebuffer
